      "updated": 1794817452946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the AI module picks up the\nentry and evaluates its\nimportance\nand chance for an incident",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the AI module picks up the entry and evaluates its importance\nand chance for an incident",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P58dNE7gX24mtBmJvd3dX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50.88372802734375,
      "y": 949.482421875,
      "width": 927.7794189453125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 24495205,
      "version": 783,
      "versionNonce": 1446584677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794818203772,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here we must discuss whether sends the entries \nmeans that they look at them when they open the system \nor that we push notifications to them;\nI think it's better if we have columns for importance (Low, Med, High, ExtraHigh)\nand chanceForAccident (Low, Med, High, ExtraHigh) and when an operator opens the application\nwe sort them by these fields Paging + Cursor\n\n(Изпраща сигналите с най-висок риск с най-висок приоритет към операторите)\nТhis sounds like we have to send them eagerly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here we must discuss whether sends the entries \nmeans that they look at them when they open the system \nor that we push notifications to them;\nI think it's better if we have columns for importance (Low, Med, High, ExtraHigh)\nand chanceForAccident (Low, Med, High, ExtraHigh) and when an operator opens the application\nwe sort them by these fields Paging + Cursor\n\n(Изпраща сигналите с най-висок риск с най-висок приоритет към операторите)\nТhis sounds like we have to send them eagerly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DLakmCuv86AEHPRSOwNrq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 171.66258602822802,
      "y": 1302.2063357662112,
      "width": 724.779541015625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
